cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "ECABSD: Explainable Cross Attention Model for Binding Site Discovery"
abstract: >
  ECABSD is a deep learning framework for per-residue protein–protein
  binding site prediction using a 6-layer GATv2 graph encoder, global
  context pooling, and multi-head cross-attention. It supports
  explainability via attention rollout and Grad-CAM, as well as
  downstream docking integration with AutoDock Vina.
